{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108846","id":2682901729,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6f6dTh","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108846","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108846.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108846.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108846","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108846/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108846/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108846/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/cbf58b93dec81bf0cd7cc908b26f2a9e85f384b6","number":108846,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Remove XAudio2 support","user":{"login":"kus04e4ek","id":118438257,"node_id":"U_kgDOBw85cQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118438257?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kus04e4ek","html_url":"https://github.com/kus04e4ek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kus04e4ek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kus04e4ek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kus04e4ek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kus04e4ek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kus04e4ek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kus04e4ek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kus04e4ek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kus04e4ek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kus04e4ek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Why remove support?\r\n\r\nXAudio2 driver is not being developed:\r\n- XAudio2 driver can only be compiled using MSVC (didn't actually test, might be broken with MSVC as well);\r\n- No new features have been implemented in quite a long time (most of the recent changes are stylistic or were just applied to all audio drivers).\r\n\r\nXAudio2 driver is not being used:\r\n- There are no issues/proposals for the 4.x releases mentioning XAudio2;\r\n- There's an audio driver for Windows that Godot supports better.\r\n\r\n|                          | XAudio2    | WASAPI                                                  |\r\n|--------------------------|:---:|:---:|\r\n| Microphone support       |      -     |                            +                            |\r\n| Audio channels supported |      2     |                           1-8                           |\r\n| Audio formats supported  | 16-bit PCM | 8-bit PCM,16-bit PCM, 24-bit PCM, 32-bit PCM, float PCM |\r\n\r\nMicrophone support [can't be implemented it seems](https://gamedev.stackexchange.com/questions/128741/using-xaudio2-to-process-microphone-input) (at least without using multiple audio drivers at once) while every other missing feature can be, however there are no requests from users.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>This fixes the compilation issues for me</summary>\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/drivers/xaudio2/SCsub b/drivers/xaudio2/SCsub\r\nindex cd210466a2..7ad8245a20 100644\r\n--- a/drivers/xaudio2/SCsub\r\n+++ b/drivers/xaudio2/SCsub\r\n@@ -5,4 +5,8 @@ Import(\"env\")\r\n \r\n env.add_source_files(env.drivers_sources, \"*.cpp\")\r\n env.Append(CPPDEFINES=[\"XAUDIO2_ENABLED\"])\r\n-env.Append(LINKFLAGS=[\"xaudio2_8.lib\"])\r\n+\r\n+if env.msvc:\r\n+    env.Append(LINKFLAGS=[\"xaudio2_8.lib\"])\r\n+else:\r\n+    env.Append(LIBS=[\"xaudio2_8\"])\r\ndiff --git a/drivers/xaudio2/audio_driver_xaudio2.h b/drivers/xaudio2/audio_driver_xaudio2.h\r\nindex 1946cdb542..12a87ddbb5 100644\r\n--- a/drivers/xaudio2/audio_driver_xaudio2.h\r\n+++ b/drivers/xaudio2/audio_driver_xaudio2.h\r\n@@ -35,7 +35,6 @@\r\n #include \"core/templates/safe_refcount.h\"\r\n #include \"servers/audio_server.h\"\r\n \r\n-#include <mmsystem.h>\r\n #define WIN32_LEAN_AND_MEAN\r\n #include <windows.h>\r\n #include <wrl/client.h>\r\n\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n## Why was it added?\r\n\r\nIt [was added to support UWP](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/6363), however there are no plans to support UWP in Godot 4, so I don't really see an use case for it now.\r\n\r\nThis PR can always be reverted if an use case for XAudio2 appears, but I don't think there's any reason to support it now. However it's low maintenance, the files can just stay exactly as they were and I don't think anyone will complain. And hey, Godot 4.5 no longer supports Windows 7, so the driver can now be enabled by default","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5793,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T14:39:14Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-07-21T19:10:50Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:18Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url